atomics: Enable Atomics
bulk_memory: Enable bulk memory operations
bulk_memory_opt: Enable bulk memory optimization operations
call_indirect_overlong: Enable overlong encoding for call_indirect immediates
exception_handling: Enable Wasm exception handling
extended_const: Enable extended const expressions
fp16: Enable FP16 instructions
gc: Enable wasm gc
multimemory: Enable multiple memories
multivalue: Enable multivalue blocks, instructions, and functions
mutable_globals: Enable mutable globals
nontrapping_bulk_memory_len0: Bulk memory operations with a zero length do not trap
nontrapping_fptoint: Enable non-trapping float-to-int conversion operators
reference_types: Enable reference types
relaxed_simd: Enable relaxed-simd instructions
sign_ext: Enable sign extension operators
simd128: Enable 128-bit SIMD
tail_call: Enable tail call instructions
wide_arithmetic: Enable wide-arithmetic instructions
